40400229,11,Were the patients in the study in a clinical trial?,"Yes, the paper describes a clinical trial.","The PrEP Impact trial was a prospective, open-label, single-arm, multicentre trial conducted at 157 Sexual Health Services (SHS) across England.",The paper describes the PrEP Impact trial as a clinical study.
