40400229,15,Which drugs were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,The individuals in the study received oral PrEP consisting of tenofovir disoproxil fumarate and emtricitabine.,Participants who seroconverted during trial reported TDF/FTC PrEP use and drug resistance was associated longterm use of PrEP of TDF/FTC.,The paper focuses on PrEP usage and its impact on drug resistance.
