40938996,13,Does the paper report HIV sequences from individuals who had previously received ARV drugs?,The paper does not specify sequences from individuals who had previously received ARV drugs.,We previously reported that mutations in the viral nucleocapsid (NC) are selected in the presence of the INSTI dolutegravir (DTG).,The focus is on the selection of mutations in the context of ARV drug presence.
