40965168,14,Which drug classes were received by individuals in the study before sample sequencing?,"The study did not mention the specific drug classes received by individuals before sample sequencing, specifically mentioned that the participants were treatment naive.","Patient plasma samples were obtained from studies GS-US-380-1490, GS-US-292-0104, GS-US-200-4334, and GS-US-200-4625. Patient informed consent was obtained prior to the collection of the clinical samples used in this study. The plasma samples were from participants who were treatment naive to the capsid inhibitor class, had diverse HIV-1 subtypes (A, A1, AE, AG, B, C, D, F1, G, H), and had HIV-1 RNA ranging from 3130 to 647000 copies/ml.",The study specifically mentions that the participants were treatment naive.
