41056006,7,What method was used for sequencing?,Not applicable.,No HIV-1 RNA <50 copies/mL at last study visit.,The study does not mention any sequencing methods as no sequencing was performed.
41056006,8,Were samples cloned prior to sequencing?,Not applicable.,No HIV-1 RNA <50 copies/mL at last study visit.,"The study does not mention any cloning of samples prior to sequencing, as no sequencing was done."
