41091504,4,Which HIV genes were reported to have been sequenced?,HIV-1 protease was reported to have been sequenced.,This experimental data set and the relatively small size of the enzyme-inhibitor complex make HIV-1 protease an ideal model system for us and many others.,"The evidence indicates that the focus of the paper is on HIV-1 protease, particularly in relation to drug resistance."
